{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/solid-table"},{"type":"text","value":" adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of it's job is related to managing state the \"solid\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"createsolidtable","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createSolidTable"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Takes an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"options"},{"type":"text","value":" object and returns a table."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createSolidTable } from '@tanstack/solid-table'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = createSolidTable(options)\n\n  // ...render your table\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"createsolidtable","text":"createSolidTable","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `@tanstack/solid-table` adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of it's job is related to managing state the \"solid\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates.\n\n## `createSolidTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table.\n\n```tsx\nimport { createSolidTable } from '@tanstack/solid-table'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = createSolidTable(options)\n\n  // ...render your table\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Solid Table\n---\n\nThe `@tanstack/solid-table` adapter is a wrapper around the core table logic. Most of it's job is related to managing state the \"solid\" way, providing types and the rendering implementation of cell/header/footer templates.\n\n## `createSolidTable`\n\nTakes an `options` object and returns a table.\n\n```tsx\nimport { createSolidTable } from '@tanstack/solid-table'\n\nfunction App() {\n  const table = createSolidTable(options)\n\n  // ...render your table\n}\n```\n"}
